Commands:
```bash
# ZPQ benchmark (uses standard files automatically)
just bench native local local local 10mb 3

# Compare with other engines
just engine polars local 100mb 3
just engine duckdb local 100mb 3

# Full comparison
just compare local local 100mb 3
```

Build for benchmarks: `zig build -Doptimize=ReleaseFast`
